ath and destruction in their wake. Desperate for peace, humanity agreed to make regular sacrificial offerings to the tentacles. One of those important sacrifices is a beautiful lady. She battles the tentacles in the arena and once she's defeated, they turn her into a spawning bed. This is all that stands between humanity and extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our little lady will also face a mysterious enemy in the arena. Use your amazing skills to defeat her, complete all the levels and escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650590/extras/487bad8ab1c239e43548d0444ee2d0d8.poster.avif?t=1752804884\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650590/extras/487bad8ab1c239e43548d0444ee2d0d8.webm?t=1752804884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650590/extras/487bad8ab1c239e43548d0444ee2d0d8.mp4?t=1752804884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc19Game Details\ud83d\udc19</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in the arena against the tentacles and monsters. Gain new items every time you defeat a wave of enemies. Combine various items to find the build that suits you best and crush these depraved aliens in one fell swoop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc19Game Features\ud83d\udc19</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Challenging and varied rogue-like gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650590/extras/b5983dc039356804a2b8c9689763f3fc.poster.avif?t=1752804884\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.ak